53. Hon'ble High Court of Delhi in Allied Blenders @ Distillers Private Ltd vs Hermes Distillery Private Ltd CS(COMM) 274/2021 and I.As. 7301/2021 & 4441/2023 decided on 15th January 2024,
while dealing with the issue of deceptive similarity relied upon Amritdhara Pharmacy vs Satya Deo,
AIR, 1963 SC 449 wherein Court held the Lakshmandhara and Amritdhara to be deceptively similar considering the consumer base and the use of the product.
